{"seq":3,"slug":"cover-snapping","title":"吸附与占据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-cover-systems/detection/cover-snapping","wordCount":1554,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"吸附与占据\">吸附与占据</h1><p>掩体点已经检测出来了，但玩家按下贴墙键时，角色不会瞬间瞬移到那个点上——它得平滑地滑过去、对齐墙面、摆好姿态；如果是 AI，还得先「预订」这个点，免得三个队友争抢同一个墙角挤成一团。这一篇讲吸附（snapping，角色如何贴上掩体）与占据（occupancy，如何独占并释放掩体槽位）。它承接上两篇检测出的掩体，是从「有掩体数据」到「角色真正在用掩体」的桥。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>吸附与占据是两件事：<strong>吸附</strong>是几何问题（把角色对齐到掩体的位置和朝向），<strong>占据</strong>是资源问题（把掩体槽位当成一个只能被一人持有的锁）。二者配合，才能既让贴墙动作顺滑，又不让多个 agent 打架。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[请求贴掩体] --&gt; B[查询附近掩体点/体]&#10;  B --&gt; C{目标点可用?&lt;br/&gt;occupant 为空}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[找次优点或放弃]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[预订: 写入 occupant]&#10;  E --&gt; F[吸附: 插值移动+对齐法线]&#10;  F --&gt; G[进入掩体状态&lt;br/&gt;姿态匹配高度]&#10;  G --&gt; H{离开条件?&lt;br/&gt;下达移动/被击杀}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[释放: 清空 occupant]&#10;  I --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n  A[请求贴掩体] --&gt; B[查询附近掩体点/体]\n  B --&gt; C{目标点可用?&lt;br/&gt;occupant 为空}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[找次优点或放弃]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[预订: 写入 occupant]\n  E --&gt; F[吸附: 插值移动+对齐法线]\n  F --&gt; G[进入掩体状态&lt;br/&gt;姿态匹配高度]\n  G --&gt; H{离开条件?&lt;br/&gt;下达移动/被击杀}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[释放: 清空 occupant]\n  I --&gt; A</pre><p>下面这张表把吸附和占据的关注点分开列，避免混淆：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方面</th>\n<th>吸附（几何）</th>\n<th>占据（资源）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解决</td>\n<td>位置对齐、朝向对齐、姿态匹配</td>\n<td>防多人挤占、及时释放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主体</td>\n<td>玩家和 AI 都要</td>\n<td>主要为 AI（玩家一般不锁）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败后果</td>\n<td>穿墙、姿态错位、镜头怪</td>\n<td>队友重叠、决策震荡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键数据</td>\n<td>position/normal/height</td>\n<td>occupant 字段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"吸附-几何对齐与姿态匹配\">吸附：几何对齐与姿态匹配</h2><p>吸附要解决三个对齐。<strong>位置对齐</strong>：角色当前位置到掩体点位置，不能瞬移，要在几帧内插值过去，通常用带缓动的插值让起步和收尾平滑。设角色位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，每帧 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>←</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p \\leftarrow p + k\\,(p^* - p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\in (0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为跟随系数），是最简单可用的临界阻尼式逼近；讲究的用弹簧阻尼或时间参数化曲线。</p>\n<p><strong>朝向对齐</strong>：角色的贴墙方向要对齐掩体法线的反向（背贴墙、面朝安全侧）。同样用插值旋转，避免瞬间转身。<strong>姿态匹配</strong>：根据掩体高度选站姿或蹲姿——低掩体蹲、高掩体站——并触发对应的贴墙动画状态。这一步与动画系统交接，混合与手感细节留给<a href=\"../practice/cover-tuning\">调校与手感</a>。</p>\n<p>对<strong>掩体体</strong>（连续边）而言，吸附还多一层：把角色投影到边上求参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，之后玩家左右移动就是改 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>、沿边滑动。这套线段参数化在<a href=\"../foundations/cover-model\">掩体数据模型</a>里已定义。玩家吸附通常还带<strong>磁吸</strong>——靠近掩体边一定距离就自动吸上，宽容度设计见调校篇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"占据-把掩体槽位当成锁\">占据：把掩体槽位当成锁</h2><p>多个 AI 抢掩体是掩体系统最常见的翻车现场：三个敌人挤进同一个墙角、你推我搡、决策来回震荡。根治办法是把每个掩体点当成一个<strong>独占资源</strong>，用 <code>occupant</code> 字段（存实体 id，空为可用）实现一把锁。</p>\n<p>标准流程是<strong>预订—吸附—释放</strong>三段：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>预订（reserve）</strong>：AI 决定去某掩体点后，先原子地把 <code>occupant</code> 设成自己的 id。若已被占，就退而求其次选别的点。预订要在「决定去」的时刻做，而不是「走到了」才做——否则两个 AI 会同时冲向同一个点，走到才发现撞车。</li>\n<li><strong>占据</strong>：走到并吸附后，正式占据，期间该点对其他 AI 不可选。</li>\n<li><strong>释放（release）</strong>：AI 离开（下达新移动指令、被击杀、掩体被破坏）时立即清空 <code>occupant</code>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>释放最容易漏。一个 AI 死了没释放它的掩体点，那个点就永久「幽灵占用」，其他 AI 再也不敢用。所以释放要挂在所有可能的离开路径上：死亡回调、状态切换、掩体失效事件都要触发释放。这类「忘记释放锁」的 bug 排查见<a href=\"../practice/cover-systems-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预订失效与重叠体积\">预订失效与重叠体积</h2><p>光有一把锁还不够，因为掩体点是离散的，两个相邻点可能物理上重叠——各自没被占，但同时站人还是会挤在一起。两种补强：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>占用半径</strong>：预订一个点时，同时把它周围一定半径内的其他点也标记为「受阻」，避免相邻点被同时占。等价于给每个占据者一个身位气泡。</li>\n<li><strong>动态失效</strong>：掩体被破坏、威胁绕到侧面使该点不再安全时，主动通知占据者「你这个点废了」，触发它重选。这与<a href=\"dynamic-cover-detection\">动态掩体检测</a>的失效事件是同一套通知机制。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>占用半径的判据很简单：新预订点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与所有已占点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lVert p^* - p_i \\rVert &lt; r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 则拒绝。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 取角色胶囊半径的两三倍即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"玩家与-ai-的吸附差异\">玩家与 AI 的吸附差异</h2><p>玩家和 AI 共用检测数据，但吸附行为要区别对待：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>玩家</th>\n<th>AI</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触发</td>\n<td>主动按键 + 磁吸辅助</td>\n<td>决策系统指派</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>占据</td>\n<td>一般不锁（玩家优先）</td>\n<td>严格预订/释放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目标选择</td>\n<td>玩家意图（就近/朝向输入）</td>\n<td>打分选点（暴露评估）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>宽容度</td>\n<td>高（磁吸、缓冲、防误触）</td>\n<td>低（精确对齐即可）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>玩家一般不参与占据锁——如果玩家想贴的墙被 AI 占了就贴不上去，体验极差；通常让玩家优先，必要时把占据该点的 AI 挤走。AI 的目标选择走打分（见<a href=\"../usage/exposure-lof\">暴露与视线</a>和<a href=\"../practice/ai-cover-usage\">AI 利用掩体</a>），玩家的目标选择走意图（就近的、朝输入方向的掩体）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>吸附是几何问题（位置/朝向/姿态三重对齐，用插值平滑贴上），占据是资源问题（把掩体槽位当独占锁）。</li>\n<li>占据走「预订—占据—释放」三段，预订要在决策时刻做，释放要挂在所有离开路径上，漏释放会造成幽灵占用。</li>\n<li>用占用半径避免相邻点重叠站人，用动态失效通知让占据者在掩体失效时重选。</li>\n<li>玩家吸附强调磁吸与宽容度、一般不锁，AI 吸附强调精确对齐与严格预订、目标来自打分。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>占据字段与体参数化的定义：<a href=\"../foundations/cover-model\">掩体数据模型</a></li>\n<li>贴上之后能做的动作：<a href=\"../usage/peek-corners\">边角探头</a></li>\n<li>AI 如何打分选点：<a href=\"../practice/ai-cover-usage\">AI 利用掩体</a></li>\n<li>吸附的插值/阻尼与摄像机同源：<a href=\"../../game-camera-systems/foundations/camera-follow-damping\">33_game-camera-systems 跟随与阻尼</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"吸附与占据","id":"吸附与占据"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"吸附：几何对齐与姿态匹配","id":"吸附-几何对齐与姿态匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"占据：把掩体槽位当成锁","id":"占据-把掩体槽位当成锁"},{"level":2,"text":"预订失效与重叠体积","id":"预订失效与重叠体积"},{"level":2,"text":"玩家与 AI 的吸附差异","id":"玩家与-ai-的吸附差异"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"动态掩体检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-cover-systems/detection/dynamic-cover-detection"},"next":{"title":"边角探头","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-cover-systems/usage/peek-corners"}}